{"data": {"Page": {"pageInfo": {"currentPage": 12, "hasNextPage": true}, "media": [{"id": 133728, "title": {"romaji": "Hua Jianghu: Huan Shi Men Sheng 2", "english": null}, "format": "ONA", "description": "The second season of <i>Hua Jianghu: Huan Shi Men Sheng</i>.", "startDate": {"year": 2021, "month": 5}, "endDate": {"year": 2021, "month": 9}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 19, "duration": 19, "countryOfOrigin": "CN", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Action", "Drama", "Fantasy", "Romance"], "tags": [{"name": "Full CGI", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 133774, "title": {"romaji": "Jiu Tian Xuan Di Jue", "english": "The Success Of Empyrean Xuan Emperor"}, "format": "ONA", "description": null, "startDate": {"year": 2021, "month": 8}, "endDate": {"year": 2021, "month": 12}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 40, "duration": 10, "countryOfOrigin": "CN", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Action", "Fantasy"], "tags": [{"name": "Male Protagonist", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Revenge", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Martial Arts", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "School", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Demons", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Full CGI", "rank": 73, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Cultivation", "rank": 73, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Cannibalism", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Gods", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Wuxia", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Anthropomorphism", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 133798, "title": {"romaji": "Yoshimaho", "english": null}, "format": "ONA", "description": "In the anime, the protagonist is overworked and always exhausted by daily life, and yearns for comfort and solace. They want to be kindly praised and healed. They think, \"Children have it nice because they're spoiled.\" The protagonist wants to escape from reality, and so they go to a store and purchase a blue pacifier. When they put the pacifier in their mouth, it emits a strange light, and it magically transports the protagonist to another world. The protagonist is now in the body of a five-year-old child, and spends time at a day care center where there are many handsome men who are caregivers there. The caregivers use the \"There, There Magic\" to soothe the children at the day care center.\n<br><br>\n(Source: Anime News Network)", "startDate": {"year": 2021, "month": 7}, "endDate": {"year": 2021, "month": 9}, "season": "SUMMER", "seasonYear": 2021, "episodes": 12, "duration": 1, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": "#よしまほ", "genres": [], "tags": [{"name": "Primarily Male Cast", "rank": 100, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Cute Boys Doing Cute Things", "rank": 96, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "POV", "rank": 92, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Age Regression", "rank": 90, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Male Harem", "rank": 73, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Isekai", "rank": 48, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Ensemble Cast", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 133849, "title": {"romaji": "Ensemble Stars!! 5th Anniversary ANIMATION PV", "english": null}, "format": "ONA", "description": "An animation commemorating the 5th year anniversary of the <i>Ensemble Stars!!</i> mobile game. <br>\nThe theme song track is \"Walk with your smile Acoustic Ver.\"", "startDate": {"year": 2021, "month": 4}, "endDate": {"year": 2021, "month": 4}, "season": "SPRING", "seasonYear": 2021, "episodes": 1, "duration": 5, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "VIDEO_GAME", "hashtag": "#あんスタ #あんスタ5周年", "genres": ["Music", "Slice of Life"], "tags": [{"name": "Idol", "rank": 91, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Primarily Male Cast", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Ensemble Cast", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Cute Boys Doing Cute Things", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Advertisement", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 133869, "title": {"romaji": "Kuang Shenmo Zun", "english": null}, "format": "ONA", "description": "A world where humans, beasts, demons, gods, dragons and pixies fight for supremacy; A war where great beast warriors of the Baemon troop, the dragon knights that soar in the sky, and the demon race that befell into the angel troops battle.\n<br><br>\nA mixed blood child, who bears the blood of a human, demon and beast, went through hardships that no other people had, and has unmatched wild war potential. He is destined to restructure the chess pieces of this world, and also fated to have an exceptional heart-wrenching love life", "startDate": {"year": 2021, "month": 5}, "endDate": {"year": 2021, "month": 11}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 62, "duration": null, "countryOfOrigin": "CN", "source": "WEB_NOVEL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Fantasy"], "tags": [{"name": "Full CGI", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Cultivation", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 133965, "title": {"romaji": "Komi-san wa, Komyushou desu.", "english": "Komi Can’t Communicate"}, "format": "TV", "description": "Timid Tadano is a total wallflower, and that’s just the way he likes it. But all that changes when he finds himself alone in a classroom on the first day of high school with the legendary Komi. He quickly realizes she isn’t aloof—she’s just super awkward. Now he’s made it his mission to help her on her quest to make 100 friends!<br>\n<br>\n(Source: VIZ Media)", "startDate": {"year": 2021, "month": 10}, "endDate": {"year": 2021, "month": 12}, "season": "FALL", "seasonYear": 2021, "episodes": 12, "duration": 24, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "MANGA", "hashtag": "#古見さん #komisan", "genres": ["Comedy", "Romance", "Slice of Life"], "tags": [{"name": "School", "rank": 96, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Kuudere", "rank": 92, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Disability", "rank": 89, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Female Protagonist", "rank": 87, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Episodic", "rank": 87, "isAdult": f